gomodel:6a607ed200000038
        a                      owl:Ontology ;
        rdfs:comment           "Created with GO AI HUB." , "Built by claude4go. v2 mouse rebuild of FOXO-CDKN1B signaling, structure per human v3 (gomodel:6a4e740f00000268), mouse orthologs & per-edge evidence per mouse model gomodel:6a4e740f00000912. Rebuilt clean from scratch: the two orphan gene-product individuals in 912 (a duplicate Akt1 and an orphan Foxo1) were NOT reproduced. ISS transfers carry with/from (HNF4A arm -> rat RGD:2810; AKT spine & FOXO transfers -> human orthologs). AKT spine curated as ISS (transferred)." ;
        lego:conforms_to_gpad  false ;
        lego:modelstate        "development" ;
